# Frontier Image Studio & Multi-Model Style Synthesis

This skill brings state-of-the-art image generation capabilities to Claude Code and Google Antigravity, mastering the distinct aesthetic styles of ChatGPT (DALL-E 3), Gemini (Imagen 3), and Flux.1 with automated multi-backend dispatch.

---

## 🎨 1. Frontier Style Prompt Formulas

When authoring prompts for image generation, apply the exact stylistic syntax for the requested aesthetic:

### A. ChatGPT / DALL-E 3 Style
* **Core Aesthetics:** Stylized 3D digital art, Pixar/Disney claymation, isometric dioramas, clean vector graphics, vibrant whimsical lighting.
* **Prompt Formula:**
  ```text
  [Subject & Action], in the style of a detailed 3D digital illustration, isometric perspective, soft subsurface scattering, vibrant warm color palette, studio rim lighting, octane render, 8k resolution, whimsical, detailed miniature textures.
  ```

### B. Gemini / Imagen 3 Style
* **Core Aesthetics:** Photorealistic optical realism, studio commercial product photography, legible typography/text, natural depth of field, authentic skin/material textures.
* **Prompt Formula:**
  ```text
  A photograph of [Subject], shot on Hasselblad H6D-100c, 85mm f/1.4 lens, natural diffuse morning window light, subtle film grain, authentic physical texture, shallow depth of field, commercial editorial photography, hyper-detailed, with text clearly displaying "[Exact Text]".
  ```

### C. Flux.1 / Midjourney Cinematic Style
* **Core Aesthetics:** 35mm anamorphic film, moody atmospheric lighting, atmospheric haze, raw unfiltered realism.
* **Prompt Formula:**
  ```text
  Cinematic 35mm photograph of [Subject], anamorphic widescreen lens, volumetric fog, dramatic chiaroscuro lighting, Kodak Vision3 500T film stock, moody color grading, tactile grit.
  ```

